WEBVTT

00:01.700 --> 00:02.940
Oh, Chief?

00:03.490 --> 00:06.900
I was able to make an appointment, 
so I'm going to meet the client now.

00:09.430 --> 00:11.110
<i>Well, that went awful...</i>

00:11.660 --> 00:13.820
<i>And here I thought it would work out.</i>

00:13.820 --> 00:16.070
<i>No, wait. They weren't my only client.</i>

00:16.950 --> 00:18.580
<i>I'll get the next one for sure!</i>

00:19.790 --> 00:26.450
<i>With these work-hardened legs,
I'll walk to as many clients as I have to</i>

00:26.450 --> 00:28.740
<i>in order to reach my goal!</i>

00:35.820 --> 00:37.300
Thank you very much!

00:40.020 --> 00:44.530
I hit my quota! 
Now I'll get that promotion for sure!

00:49.190 --> 00:51.530
I did it... I did it!

00:53.490 --> 00:55.700
W-Wait!

00:57.010 --> 01:00.280
<i>I'll head back and celebrate with everyone.</i>

01:01.930 --> 01:03.950
Don't move!

01:11.310 --> 01:14.050
<i>Ow... What in the world?</i>

01:16.980 --> 01:17.960
Call an ambulance!

01:17.960 --> 01:19.440
Somebody help!

01:19.440 --> 01:22.410
<i>I'm getting a promotion...</i>

01:22.960 --> 01:24.810
<i>I gotta get back...</i>

01:25.160 --> 01:29.080
<i>and celebrate with everyone...</i>

01:33.360 --> 01:36.780
I can't die like this

01:44.130 --> 01:46.440
<i>You, unfortunate soul...</i>

01:48.950 --> 01:53.370
<i>You are bound for a land of earth and sea,
much like this planet.</i>

01:53.370 --> 01:56.090
<i>A realm of magic and monsters.</i>

01:56.090 --> 01:59.610
<i>I shall reincarnate you in such a world.</i>

02:08.270 --> 02:10.640
"Reincarnate"?

02:17.940 --> 02:21.860
<i>And that's how, 
by the power of... God, I think?</i>

02:21.860 --> 02:24.910
<i>I was reincarnated in the world of Galdardia.</i>

02:28.540 --> 02:32.790
<b>The Great Cleric</b>

02:29.620 --> 02:32.790
A Salaryman's <b>Path </b>to <b>Surviving Another World</b>

04:04.190 --> 04:07.760
That's... a dragon, isn't it?

04:07.760 --> 04:10.470
Moreover, what's this about reincarnation?

04:08.260 --> 04:12.730
#1 The Healers' Guild

04:12.060 --> 04:14.660
Wait, this isn't my suit.

04:15.230 --> 04:17.650
<i>I shall grant you basic knowledge.</i>

04:17.650 --> 04:23.990
<i>If you wish to survive, recite 
"status open" to see your status.</i>

04:23.990 --> 04:27.570
Uh... S-Status open?

04:29.580 --> 04:33.080
<b>Name:\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hUnspecified</b>

04:29.580 --> 04:33.080
<b>Job:\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hUnspecified</b>

04:29.590 --> 04:33.080
Hey, hey, hey! This is just like a game!

04:30.060 --> 04:33.080
<b>Age:</b>

04:30.770 --> 04:33.080
<b>Level:</b>

04:33.080 --> 04:36.320
<i>Your race and age were predetermined.</i>

04:36.320 --> 04:39.040
<i>The rest you may decide for yourself.</i>

04:39.040 --> 04:43.830
<i>May your new life be a blessed one.</i>

04:47.600 --> 04:51.140
Wow, I really did get reincarnated...

04:52.590 --> 04:56.240
Let's see... Hmm...

04:56.590 --> 04:57.980
There! All done.

04:57.980 --> 05:01.070
<b>Name:\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hLuciel</b>

04:59.530 --> 05:01.070
I'm Luciel!

05:01.070 --> 05:05.180
Luciel. Luciel, Luciel, Luciel...

05:05.870 --> 05:07.450
Now then...

05:07.450 --> 05:12.900
For skills, I took assess mastery, 
martial arts, and magic control.

05:07.450 --> 05:13.350
<b>Assess Mastery</b>

05:07.450 --> 05:13.390
<b>Martial Arts</b>

05:07.450 --> 05:13.430
<b>Magic Control</b>

05:07.450 --> 05:17.740
<b>Monster Luck</b>

05:12.900 --> 05:17.750
Then lastly, monster luck!
Can't have too much of that right now.

05:18.120 --> 05:19.210
Next up...

05:19.210 --> 05:19.880
<b>Name:\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\h\hLuciel</b>

05:19.210 --> 05:19.880
<b>Job:</b>

05:19.210 --> 05:19.880
<b>Age:</b>

05:19.210 --> 05:19.880
<b>Level:</b>

05:19.210 --> 05:20.880
For my job, I chose healer!

05:19.210 --> 05:24.920
<b>Healer</b>

05:22.360 --> 05:24.920
<i>Running support is kind of a background gig,</i>

05:25.290 --> 05:26.870
<i>but if I train hard enough,</i>

05:26.870 --> 05:30.470
<i>I can help people out and 
potentially bag some steady work.</i>

05:32.070 --> 05:36.350
<i>Besides, I don't have the courage
to face monsters myself!</i>

05:36.350 --> 05:40.310
Now... I guess this is my
entire fortune for the time being.

05:41.950 --> 05:47.860
Well, you're considered an adult at fifteen
in this world, so I should go on find work.

05:49.890 --> 05:51.850
What the heck? Huh?!

05:52.330 --> 05:56.080
A m-m-m-m-monster corpse?!

05:56.080 --> 06:00.500
<i>I was lucky to get reincarnated! 
I can't let my death be the end!</i>

06:00.500 --> 06:02.800
<i>I swear, in this life...</i>

06:03.500 --> 06:05.650
<i>I'm going to die of old age!</i>

06:11.800 --> 06:14.520
It sure is big.

06:18.470 --> 06:21.190
<i>Huh? People are showing
something to the guard.</i>

06:21.190 --> 06:24.020
<i>Could it be some kind of ID?</i>

06:24.750 --> 06:26.610
<i>There's even a toll?!</i>

06:26.610 --> 06:28.010
Next person.

06:28.010 --> 06:29.110
Coming.

06:31.830 --> 06:33.080
Your identification.

06:33.080 --> 06:36.910
<i>I knew it! Hmm, what should I do?</i>

06:36.910 --> 06:38.110
<i>Got it!</i>

06:38.110 --> 06:41.450
I beg your pardon, but I have no 
documents to prove my identity.

06:41.450 --> 06:42.580
What?

06:43.160 --> 06:44.870
I was raised in a small village.

06:44.870 --> 06:48.250
When I came of age, I became a healer.

06:45.550 --> 06:51.800
BUSINESS MODE

06:48.910 --> 06:51.800
But my village had no use for me,
so I was cast out.

06:51.800 --> 06:55.410
If given the chance,
I was hoping to train at a clinic.

06:55.810 --> 06:57.120
Would that be possible?

06:58.050 --> 06:59.520
Wait here a moment.

06:59.920 --> 07:02.940
<i>I thought I was making good use
of the knowledge I was given,</i>

07:03.360 --> 07:05.320
<i>but did I botch that?</i>

07:05.930 --> 07:08.420
<i>Worst case, I'll book it as fast as I can!</i>

07:08.420 --> 07:09.700
Is it you?

07:09.700 --> 07:11.880
Are you the one who wants to join a clinic?

07:15.700 --> 07:17.790
Y-Yes.

07:18.180 --> 07:20.750
I came hoping to find work in this town.

07:22.460 --> 07:25.960
Lumina

07:23.430 --> 07:26.580
Follow me.
I'll take you to the Healers' Guild.

07:26.950 --> 07:28.370
Wh-What about the toll?

07:28.370 --> 07:33.370
Get going, young man. We don't collect 
tolls from healers, so don't worry.

07:33.370 --> 07:36.600
Is that right? Thank you very much!

07:36.600 --> 07:38.520
<i>Whoa, she's already that far ahead?!</i>

07:38.520 --> 07:40.480
<i>Never keep a business partner waiting!</i>

07:42.230 --> 07:43.540
Ow, ow, ow...

07:43.540 --> 07:46.610
Hey. Watch where you're going.

07:46.610 --> 07:48.450
Y-Yes, sir!

07:48.640 --> 07:50.320
<i>Are they adventurers?</i>

07:50.320 --> 07:53.070
Where are you going in such a hurry?

07:53.070 --> 07:55.430
The Healers' Guild, sir.

07:55.430 --> 07:56.720
So you're a healer?

07:56.720 --> 07:57.970
I'm sorry!

07:57.970 --> 07:59.660
What're you apologizing for?!

08:00.370 --> 08:02.230
<i>Hang in there, me!</i>

08:02.230 --> 08:07.000
I-I can't use magic yet, so saying I'm
a healer may be an overstatement...

08:07.000 --> 08:10.920
That so? If you become a corrupt one, 
I won't let you off so easy.

08:10.920 --> 08:12.190
Don't you worry.

08:11.760 --> 08:16.800
<b>Hidden Ability
Business Smile</b>

08:12.190 --> 08:13.700
Kindness is my motto.

08:13.700 --> 08:16.800
I'll strive to be an earnest
and ethical healer people can trust.

08:17.760 --> 08:19.260
Let's get going.

08:20.150 --> 08:21.850
I thought I was a dead man...

08:21.850 --> 08:24.520
A little altercation won't kill you.

08:24.520 --> 08:30.190
That said, if they had laid a hand 
on you, I was prepared to step in.

08:30.190 --> 08:33.230
<i>Against those super tough-looking guys?</i>

08:33.230 --> 08:36.210
<i>This lady must be really strong.</i>

08:36.210 --> 08:37.700
Now then, let's be on our way.

08:37.700 --> 08:38.680
Okay!

08:45.290 --> 08:50.000
Wow, I really did get reincarnated...

08:50.000 --> 08:51.230
Did you say something?

08:51.230 --> 08:52.250
Uh, no.

08:52.250 --> 08:53.160
So be it.

08:54.110 --> 08:58.640
By the way, when I entered the city, 
I wasn't charged the toll.

08:59.180 --> 09:02.600
Only the Empire charges healers tolls.

09:02.600 --> 09:06.730
Healers deal in matters of life and death,
so they get preferential treatment.

09:06.730 --> 09:10.310
<i>What a lucky break for me!</i>

09:10.310 --> 09:13.260
<i>Must be the power of
my monster luck skill at work!</i>

09:11.610 --> 09:13.570
<b>Monster Luck</b>

09:13.900 --> 09:16.630
So being a healer is a special job, huh?

09:16.630 --> 09:17.660
I suppose so.

09:18.230 --> 09:22.250
Particularly because you stand
in the Republic of St. Shurule,

09:22.250 --> 09:26.280
home to the Healers' Guild headquarters.

09:26.650 --> 09:28.170
Is this the place?

09:28.170 --> 09:29.180
It is.

09:33.120 --> 09:36.270
Welcome to the local Healers' Guild!

09:40.800 --> 09:42.560
Thank you very much!

09:42.560 --> 09:45.080
<i>Man, get a load of that smile!</i>

09:45.080 --> 09:47.240
<i>Maybe getting reincarnated </i>was<i> a blessing!</i>

09:49.580 --> 09:53.150
Now then, please fill in 
the necessary information.

09:53.150 --> 09:56.940
<i>Uh... I can't read this.</i>

09:57.570 --> 10:00.990
Healers' Guild Registration Form

09:57.570 --> 10:00.990
Name

09:57.570 --> 10:00.990
Race

09:57.570 --> 10:00.990
Age

09:57.570 --> 10:00.990
Hometown

09:57.570 --> 10:00.990
Other

09:58.060 --> 09:59.740
<i>Wait! I can!</i>

10:00.200 --> 10:02.580
<i>Name: Luciel.</i>

10:01.120 --> 10:03.330
Healers' Guild Registration Form

10:01.120 --> 10:03.330
Name

10:01.120 --> 10:03.330
Race

10:01.120 --> 10:03.330
Age

10:01.120 --> 10:03.330
Hometown

10:01.120 --> 10:03.330
Other

10:01.120 --> 10:03.330
Luciel

10:02.580 --> 10:04.950
<i>Race: human.</i>

10:03.450 --> 10:04.950
Healers' Guild Registration Form

10:03.450 --> 10:04.950
Name

10:03.450 --> 10:04.950
Race

10:03.450 --> 10:04.950
Age

10:03.450 --> 10:04.950
Hometown

10:03.450 --> 10:04.950
Other

10:03.450 --> 10:04.950
Luciel

10:03.450 --> 10:04.950
Human

10:04.950 --> 10:09.830
Lumina-sama, if you'd called,
we would have sent a representative for you.

10:07.710 --> 10:09.830
Kururu

10:09.830 --> 10:12.790
It's fine. I was in the area,
so it was no trouble.

10:12.790 --> 10:18.580
<i>The way they're talking... This lady 
must be someone important.</i>

10:18.580 --> 10:21.760
<i>Let's see... Age: fifteen.</i>

10:21.760 --> 10:23.560
<i>Hometown?</i>

10:24.760 --> 10:27.440
<i>I don't know my hometown!</i>

10:27.440 --> 10:31.310
<i>Instead of fudging it and getting called out,
 I should just play stupid.</i>

10:31.310 --> 10:34.780
Excuse me. About my hometown...

10:34.780 --> 10:37.510
Is it all right if I just write "Village"?

10:37.510 --> 10:38.400
"Village"?

10:38.400 --> 10:40.950
I don't know if my village has a name.

10:40.950 --> 10:41.950
Huh?!

10:41.950 --> 10:42.950
<b>You stupid?</b>

10:42.950 --> 10:46.790
Er, if you don't know, 
I suppose that would be fine.

10:47.620 --> 10:51.000
<i>Th-The look on her face 
changed for a second there.</i>

10:51.000 --> 10:52.380
<i>Oh well.</i>

10:51.000 --> 10:52.960
Healers' Guild Registration Form{治癒士ギルド...}

10:51.000 --> 10:52.960
Name {名前}

10:51.000 --> 10:52.960
Race {種族}

10:51.000 --> 10:52.960
Age {年齢}

10:51.000 --> 10:52.960
Hometown {出身地}

10:51.000 --> 10:52.960
Other {その他}

10:51.000 --> 10:52.960
Luciel {ルシエル}

10:51.000 --> 10:52.960
Human {人族}

10:51.000 --> 10:52.960
Village {村}

10:52.960 --> 10:55.310
Um, I'm finished.

10:55.310 --> 10:57.920
All right. Please wait a moment.

10:57.920 --> 11:00.500
<i>Oh, that's right. I should ask while I can.</i>

11:00.900 --> 11:02.670
Lumina-san... Er, Lumina-sama.

11:02.670 --> 11:07.520
Does this town also have 
a name other than "Town"?

11:08.780 --> 11:12.810
Ugh, you really are ignorant.

11:12.810 --> 11:17.280
This is the town of Merratoni
in the Republic of St. Shurule.

11:19.120 --> 11:21.490
I-I'll try my hardest to learn!

11:21.860 --> 11:23.540
That'd be for the best.

11:23.540 --> 11:25.450
<i>Phew! That worked.</i>

11:25.450 --> 11:27.540
Thank you for waiting.

11:28.390 --> 11:30.740
Please channel your magic into this.

11:31.100 --> 11:32.790
Ah, sure.

11:32.790 --> 11:34.740
<i>Magic, huh?</i>

11:34.740 --> 11:37.840
<i>I did pick the magic control skill.</i>

11:37.840 --> 11:40.640
<i>If I concentrate, I should be able to use it.</i>

11:44.970 --> 11:47.680
Healers' Guild {治癒士ギルド}

11:44.970 --> 11:47.680
Merratoni Branch {メラトニ支部}

11:44.970 --> 11:47.680
G-Rank Healer

11:44.970 --> 11:47.680
Luciel

11:45.230 --> 11:46.590
<i>Huh?</i>

11:47.000 --> 11:49.080
Now, please hand me your card.

11:49.080 --> 11:50.030
Sure.

11:52.850 --> 11:56.210
What is she doing back there in that room?

11:56.210 --> 12:00.570
She's registering your card in 
the Healers' Guild magic network.

12:00.880 --> 12:05.870
That will allow you to use it at 
any Healers' Guild in the world.

12:05.870 --> 12:07.330
I see.

12:08.020 --> 12:09.540
Thank you for your patience.

12:09.540 --> 12:11.920
I've confirmed you're indeed a healer.

12:11.920 --> 12:15.170
You have both magic control
and the holy magic affinity.

12:15.170 --> 12:17.190
I really appreciate it.

12:17.190 --> 12:19.580
<i>She could tell all that?</i>

12:19.580 --> 12:23.260
Looks like everything's in order here. 
I'll excuse myself, then.

12:23.260 --> 12:26.130
<i>No, wait! Everything is </i>not<i> in order!</i>

12:26.130 --> 12:30.700
<i>If she leaves me hanging now,
no way am I getting a job at a clinic!</i>

12:30.700 --> 12:32.180
E-Excuse me!

12:32.180 --> 12:38.400
I've never used holy magic,
so I don't think I know how!

12:39.730 --> 12:41.110
What do you mean?

12:41.110 --> 12:43.230
<i>Wh-What a scary look!</i>

12:43.230 --> 12:47.200
<i>No, don't flinch, Luciel. 
Gotta keep acting the part!</i>

12:47.200 --> 12:49.830
Um, is that a problem?

12:49.830 --> 12:55.820
We had no spell tomes in my village.
I was the very first healer there.

12:57.710 --> 13:01.840
I'd nearly forgotten you were an ignoramus.
I suppose I have no choice...

13:03.180 --> 13:06.830
<i>I think she believes me. But what is this?</i>

13:06.830 --> 13:08.950
<i>My eyes are getting sweaty or something.</i>

13:10.160 --> 13:14.680
Would it be possible for me to apprentice
at a clinic while I learn the ropes?

13:14.680 --> 13:16.230
In that case—

13:16.230 --> 13:17.980
You have three options.

13:17.980 --> 13:23.370
One: Spartan training. Two: taking out a loan.
Three: becoming an apprentice.

13:24.130 --> 13:28.070
With Spartan training, you'll study 
hard until you learn healing spells

13:28.070 --> 13:30.760
and keep reciting them 
until you run out of magic.

13:30.760 --> 13:34.500
When your magic replenishes, 
you do it all over again.

13:34.500 --> 13:38.390
With a loan, you'll enter 
a normal educational institution

13:34.500 --> 13:46.840
<b>School</b>

13:38.390 --> 13:41.960
and study for three years to learn magic.

13:42.330 --> 13:46.840
However, you will have to repay 
the Healers' Guild one platinum coin.

13:46.840 --> 13:50.310
With an apprenticeship,
you'll perform various tasks

13:50.310 --> 13:52.660
while studying magic in your free time.

13:53.070 --> 13:54.750
Now make your choice!

13:57.160 --> 14:00.080
<i>The apprenticeship sounds 
the most reasonable,</i>

14:00.080 --> 14:02.610
<i>but I don't know
if I'll really have free time.</i>

14:02.610 --> 14:04.820
<i>The loan is basically a student loan.</i>

14:05.200 --> 14:08.450
<i>And I know from my previous life
how brutal those are.</i>

14:08.450 --> 14:11.910
<i>The Spartan training must 
be like cramming for exams.</i>

14:12.360 --> 14:16.870
<i>However Spartan it is, if I can see my
progress, like working toward a quota,</i>

14:16.870 --> 14:18.630
<i>I should be able to power through.</i>

14:18.960 --> 14:20.060
<b>Monster Luck</b>

14:18.960 --> 14:20.100
<b>Magic Control</b>

14:18.960 --> 14:20.190
<b>Martial Arts</b>

14:18.960 --> 14:21.820
<i>Thankfully, I have assess mastery,</i>

14:18.960 --> 14:26.150
<b>Assess Mastery</b>

14:21.820 --> 14:26.150
<i>which tells me how much experience
I need to improve my skills.</i>

14:26.970 --> 14:29.050
I've decided. I'll do the Spartan training.

14:29.050 --> 14:30.300
I really appreciate this!

14:33.840 --> 14:38.920
<i>W-Willingly taking the Spartan training?
He really is stupid...</i>

14:40.400 --> 14:43.500
Lumina-sama, please leave the rest to me.

14:44.190 --> 14:45.680
I'm Kururu.

14:45.680 --> 14:48.290
I'll show you to your room. Follow me.

14:48.700 --> 14:52.600
U-Um, thank you very much 
for everything, Lumina-sama.

14:52.600 --> 14:54.830
You can drop the formality.

14:54.830 --> 15:00.290
My name is Luciel.
I promise to return the favor someday!

15:00.690 --> 15:02.840
Sure. I'm looking forward to it.

15:03.280 --> 15:04.380
Good luck.

15:04.380 --> 15:07.350
<i>Good luck... Good luck... Good luck...</i>

15:07.670 --> 15:08.630
Thanks!

15:08.630 --> 15:11.500
<i>Thanks... Thanks... Thanks...</i>

15:13.800 --> 15:16.310
<i>There aren't any windows?</i>

15:18.640 --> 15:21.610
Whoa... Is this a spell tome?

15:21.610 --> 15:23.230
Okay, here I go.

15:23.230 --> 15:26.190
I guess I'll start with the basics. Okay!

15:26.190 --> 15:29.840
I'm gonna get this in ten days!

15:30.360 --> 15:34.420
"On casting first-level spells..."

15:34.420 --> 15:39.200
"When you recite spells,
magic power drains from your body."

15:39.200 --> 15:43.090
"If you succeed, your skill increases." Huh.

15:43.090 --> 15:45.340
Okay, let's give it a shot!

15:46.000 --> 15:50.760
Let's see... "By channeling your spell
with a clear mental image,

15:50.760 --> 15:54.630
your magic control, governing energies 
outside of your body, will improve."

15:54.630 --> 15:55.600
Was that it?

15:56.050 --> 15:59.700
For my mental image,
I'll picture a wounding in reverse.

16:00.870 --> 16:05.440
O Lord, I offer up my magic
so that I may mend this wound!

16:06.730 --> 16:07.720
Heal!

16:12.500 --> 16:15.200
Nothing happened?

16:15.570 --> 16:18.620
Well, I am just a commoner...

16:20.180 --> 16:21.220
Hang on.

16:21.860 --> 16:25.890
Thinking about it,
I <i>did</i> feel something leave my body.

16:26.130 --> 16:31.110
<b>Progression Status</b>

16:26.130 --> 16:31.150
<b>Holy Magic Affinity</b>

16:26.600 --> 16:30.160
Oh, great! It looks like I'm doing this right.

16:30.050 --> 16:31.190
<b>Luciel</b>

16:30.050 --> 16:31.240
<b>Healer</b>

16:30.580 --> 16:32.380
I can go another nine times.

16:32.380 --> 16:35.390
All right! I'll keep that
mental image and keep reciting!

16:35.390 --> 16:37.260
Heal!

16:37.260 --> 16:40.800
Heal! Heal!

16:39.620 --> 16:42.020
<b>9th time</b>

16:42.020 --> 16:46.100
<i>I'm recovering naturally,
but I've only gotten one MP back.</i>

16:46.100 --> 16:49.430
<i>And now I totally feel like crap!</i>

16:49.810 --> 16:53.610
<i>It's like the morning after 
I drink too much with a client...</i>

16:54.720 --> 16:57.700
Phew. I've finally recovered.

16:58.180 --> 17:01.100
If I improve my magic control 
and magic handling,

17:01.100 --> 17:03.410
the amount of magic I use should go down.

17:04.920 --> 17:07.130
Maybe I should prioritize those instead!

17:07.130 --> 17:11.590
<i>Feel the magic inside... 
and learn to wield it.</i>

17:12.130 --> 17:14.960
<i>I have to master the magic within me!</i>

17:22.220 --> 17:26.480
Crap! I'm late! No way!

17:29.060 --> 17:33.800
I guess that reincarnation
stuff really wasn't a dream...

17:34.150 --> 17:36.560
Welp, the book's already
closed on my last life.

17:36.560 --> 17:39.870
If I work hard, I might be able
to make a better life for myself here.

17:39.870 --> 17:42.020
I'll give it everything I got!

17:42.490 --> 17:44.560
So that's what I did.

17:44.910 --> 17:47.290
Step one was reciting magic.

17:48.100 --> 17:50.590
Step two was stopping
just before exhausting it.

17:51.810 --> 17:55.910
Step three was practicing my magic
handling while my MP recovered.

17:56.340 --> 17:58.630
And I kept repeating that over and over.

18:03.690 --> 18:08.020
I can't say for sure yet, but I feel like
I'm starting to get the hang of magic.

18:08.060 --> 18:14.730
<b>Progression Status</b>

18:08.480 --> 18:14.730
<b>Holy Magic Affinity</b>

18:09.230 --> 18:14.730
<b>Magic Handling</b>

18:09.440 --> 18:10.600
Whoa!

18:09.730 --> 18:14.730
<b>Magic Control</b>

18:10.230 --> 18:14.730
<b>Meditation</b>

18:10.600 --> 18:12.140
Everything's going up!

18:10.730 --> 18:14.730
<b>Focus</b>

18:11.230 --> 18:14.730
<b>Magic Recovery</b>

18:12.140 --> 18:14.730
Being able to see the numbers is really nice.

18:14.730 --> 18:18.890
As long as my efforts are rewarded 
like this, it won't break my spirit!

18:20.450 --> 18:21.570
Come in.

18:24.430 --> 18:26.440
I've brought your meal.

18:28.920 --> 18:30.880
Th-Thank you very much!

18:31.520 --> 18:35.170
It's no trouble. You need to eat well 
so you can keep working hard.

18:35.170 --> 18:38.380
Um, may I ask your name?

18:38.380 --> 18:41.090
My name is Monika.

18:39.380 --> 18:42.640
Monika

18:41.090 --> 18:43.640
It's a pleasure to meet you, Luciel-sama.

18:43.640 --> 18:45.250
Monika-san...

18:45.250 --> 18:47.800
The pleasure is mine. Nice to meet you.

18:48.350 --> 18:50.730
<b>The Third Day</b>

18:52.370 --> 18:56.730
O Lord, I offer up my magic
so that I may mend this wound!

18:57.100 --> 18:58.190
Heal!

19:00.160 --> 19:01.720
I did it!

19:04.080 --> 19:06.200
Congratulations, Luciel-sama!

19:06.200 --> 19:08.660
<b>Healers' Guild\h\h\h\h\hMerratoni Branch
G-Rank Healer
Luciel</b>

19:06.200 --> 19:09.160
I've confirmed you're able
to use the heal spell now.

19:09.160 --> 19:10.080
<b>SMUG</b>

19:10.430 --> 19:12.920
Now then, that will be one silver coin.

19:12.920 --> 19:13.710
Huh?

19:13.710 --> 19:15.420
H-Here you go.

19:15.420 --> 19:17.100
That'll cover it.

19:17.100 --> 19:19.800
So, as for what comes after this,

19:19.800 --> 19:22.260
should I go to Lumina-san for guidance?

19:22.260 --> 19:22.890
Huh?

19:23.160 --> 19:27.600
A-Are you the person Lumina-sama
brought here, Luciel-sama?!

19:27.600 --> 19:31.390
Please accept my apologies. 
I will return your silver coin.

19:31.390 --> 19:32.080
Huh?

19:32.080 --> 19:36.790
Lumina-sama made arrangements for you
to borrow the room for ten days.

19:36.790 --> 19:41.570
Sh-She did? Lumina-san must 
have a whole lot of authority.

19:41.570 --> 19:42.360
Indeed.

19:42.360 --> 19:48.900
In fact, she is the captain of the 
Church's new female paladin regiment.

19:48.900 --> 19:51.580
<i>Lumina-san really is awesome!</i>

19:51.580 --> 19:54.200
<i>Meeting her might've been a huge blessing.</i>

19:54.200 --> 19:56.810
<i>I guess my monster luck
 skill is paying off.</i>

19:56.810 --> 19:59.840
<i>I'd better make nice
and start treating it with respect!</i>

19:57.460 --> 19:59.840
<b>SENSEI</b>

19:59.840 --> 20:02.760
<i>From now on, I'll call him
Monster Luck-sensei!</i>

20:04.680 --> 20:07.630
<i>I can continue my training 
for seven more days.</i>

20:07.630 --> 20:11.640
<i>But everything after that 
is a complete blank.</i>

20:11.640 --> 20:15.100
<i>Okay! I'm out to promote myself as a healer!</i>

20:15.480 --> 20:18.830
By the way, can healers make 
money with the heal spell?

20:18.830 --> 20:20.240
Yes, they can.

20:20.240 --> 20:24.950
I think a respectable charge 
for a casting would be one silver coin.

20:24.950 --> 20:27.280
One silver for single spell?!

20:27.280 --> 20:28.990
Just so you know,

20:28.990 --> 20:34.870
guild members also have to pay dues,
known as offerings, according to their ranks.

20:35.200 --> 20:38.360
<i>I'll make good use of my business 
experience from my previous life.</i>

20:38.360 --> 20:43.020
<i>I'll find an Adventurers' Guild 
where I can work directly as a healer!</i>

20:43.020 --> 20:45.310
Hey! You over there!

20:46.000 --> 20:48.030
Aren't you that healer punk?

20:49.770 --> 20:52.230
<i>It's the adventurers from before!</i>

20:52.390 --> 20:55.310
Bazan

20:52.970 --> 20:55.180
I'm very sorry about the other day!

20:55.180 --> 20:57.810
Hey, Bazan. You're freaking the kid out.

20:57.810 --> 21:01.120
Maybe because Bazan's face is so intimidating.

21:01.120 --> 21:02.460
He <i>is</i> pretty scary.

21:02.460 --> 21:03.530
Shut up!

21:03.530 --> 21:07.950
<i>These guys are a little scary, but maybe 
I can ask them about the Adventurers' Guild.</i>

21:07.950 --> 21:10.030
B-Bazan-san!

21:12.000 --> 21:14.120
H-Hey! Guys!

21:14.450 --> 21:15.860
What happened to you?!

21:15.860 --> 21:18.540
I'm sorry. We screwed up.

21:18.540 --> 21:20.150
You idiot!

21:20.150 --> 21:23.820
I told you to turn down dangerous 
requests while you're still a novice!

21:24.290 --> 21:26.630
That looks really bad.

21:26.630 --> 21:30.220
And we can't count on a clinic.

21:34.050 --> 21:36.810
I hesitate to speak of this, but at present,

21:36.810 --> 21:42.530
the Healers' Guild cannot
censure clinics or healers.

21:42.530 --> 21:44.570
What do you mean?

21:44.570 --> 21:48.330
If a healer charges exorbitant prices 
or causes confrontation,

21:48.330 --> 21:51.660
headquarters used to dispatch someone.

21:51.660 --> 21:55.940
However, their schemes
are so devious these days

21:55.940 --> 21:59.830
that I'm afraid the law
cannot keep up with them.

22:01.220 --> 22:03.380
Then I promise you this...

22:04.240 --> 22:08.240
I will never become a corrupt healer!

22:12.510 --> 22:13.740
Excuse me!

22:16.510 --> 22:18.440
I will heal them!

23:55.580 --> 23:57.910
Wow, that totally ended on a cliffhanger!

23:57.910 --> 24:01.250
Can a novice healer like me 
really save someone's life?

24:01.250 --> 24:02.590
I've only been reincarnated a week.

24:02.590 --> 24:04.790
In an office, I'd still just be observing!

24:04.790 --> 24:06.500
Next time: "The Adventurers' Guild."

24:06.500 --> 24:08.370
This is when I start reaching for greatness!

24:06.500 --> 24:09.960
#2 The Adventurers' Guild

24:08.370 --> 24:09.920
It is, right?
